0.6 w 54.00 747.00 m 558.00 747.00 l S
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (make money on the average. Only a dozen of the hundreds of US offices are profitable at any given time,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (and not always the same ones, so from a business point of view it is more like a lottery [Dd9V4RSqNuk @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (00:03:34]. Lesley Millar-Nicholson backs that with AUTM numbers from 1991 to 2022. Every $1 of research) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (funding earned roughly 4 cents, licensing income runs 3.5 to 4% of research spend, and only 14% of US) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (offices cover their operating costs [BtnDins-U4g @ 00:29:32]. The Salk director says offices pull 80 or 90%) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (of revenue from two or three inventions. All the other inventions put together make up 10 to 20%, which the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (director calls a game of home runs [3iEjObMZnZo @ 00:07:18]. Ohio State's office measured the tail) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (directly. Only 0.1% of all inventions ever disclosed reached $1M cumulative, against 0.8% at Stanford. Every) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (office clearing $100M has a drug behind it, and without that drug over 90% of revenue disappears) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm ([HKAvhkDKxNQ @ 00:27:16]. The office calls it an accidental success it is hoping for, while insisting the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (process itself stays disciplined.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (The second point of agreement is that university inventions arrive brutally early and pay slowly. Nelsen) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (describes technology that worked in the lab and maybe in a mouse but is going to take years. Federal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (funding stops right around publication, while pharma only wants clinic-ready assets. Development costs tens) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (of millions for devices and hundreds of millions for drugs [Dd9V4RSqNuk @ 00:02:47]. Millar-Nicholson) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (maps the valley of death in three stages: 2 to 3 years to an issued patent, 2 to 3 more to form a business,) Tj ET
