BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (leasing a legally protected name, character, logo or design to someone who puts it on goods and pays a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (royalty [TwdLXgIhXJA @ 00:00:00]. Daymond John splits it into inbound and outbound. Inbound means you) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (lease someone else's IP, slap it on your product and pay the owner a vig; outbound means you own the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (asset and collect, ideally with an advance plus a percentage [knoob7eUS6Y @ 00:00:51]. Stephen Key, who) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (built Hot Picks guitar picks, found that brand licensing is product licensing run in reverse: the terms are the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (same, except the manufacturer is now licensing in the brand instead of an inventor licensing out an idea) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm ([WMcwXYcUD5c @ 00:02:33]. Stu Seltzer, who worked the Batman brand in-house at Warner Brothers,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (frames the two seats plainly. The licensor is the brand owner pushing out brand equity; the licensee is the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (manufacturer pulling it in to spike sales, exactly as LEGO did when it took its first-ever license, Star Wars, in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (1998 while sitting near bankruptcy, and ended up with roughly half its line licensed [3tCB_MAOXkA @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (00:02:46]. The consensus: whichever seat you take, the money comes from borrowed consumer trust.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (The second point of agreement is brutal: nobody pays for a name with no pull. Daymond John's test is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (whether your brand lets a licensee raise the price or move more units; if a jeans maker selling 1,000 pairs a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (month at $100 adds your 15% license and still moves 1,000 pairs, they are just paying you for nothing, so) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (the license has to push them toward 10,000 pairs at $115 [knoob7eUS6Y @ 00:08:15]. Seltzer screens) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (readiness with three questions: how many people know the brand, whether they know what it stands for, and) Tj ET
