BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (@ 01:19:44]) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (If you are caught using an image, pulling it down does not cure the infringement; do not get defensive or) Tj ET
