BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (00:11:29]) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (For music, cap any clip at 10 to 15 seconds and never use the whole song; the better play is to skip) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (copyrighted songs and use royalty-free sound [DesignLab UW-Madison - mGWJAAFhtRk @ 00:02:58]) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (When designing around a patent, clear every independent claim, including method claims, since patents) Tj ET
