BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (Jwz-iMwUtCU @ 00:07:47]) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (Where Practitioners Disagree & Alternative Playbooks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 488.85 Tm (On stopping an unauthorized seller, the practitioners split between the platform lever and the courtroom) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 473.62 Tm (lever. Torys LLP works the notice route: a platform served with a complaint may forward it to the vendor or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 458.40 Tm (pull the listing, but it is "unlikely to do much more," and trademark claims move faster than patent claims) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 443.17 Tm (because the platform is "arguably advertising" and proof is often just the registration [ijF0IyvjXXg @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 427.95 Tm (00:05:39]. LawShelf maps the heavy alternative: federal court or the ITC, venue limited after TC Heartland) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 412.72 Tm (\(2017\), claim charts, a Markman hearing, up to 10 depositions per party, a jury trial and a Federal Circuit) Tj ET
