BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (Detail: Make the agreement decide the model's fate, cover legally required retention exceptions, and keep a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (provenance record of origin, license, uses and restrictions [Archive Trove - y5YpFZxHpYE @ 00:02:17]) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (The AI-data pipeline runs on a manifest, not a pitch deck. micro1 lays out four moves: fill out a manifest form) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (in under 10 minutes listing rough data size per source, such as Google Workspace at 3 TB and Slack at 300) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (GB; receive pricing within a few days based on employee count and data size; sign the licensing agreement;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (then export, anonymize and collect payout roughly 60 days after engagement [Sya3mBgQK7Q @ 00:02:15].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (Varner's version routes the company through an introducer to a data lab via that manifest, with a couple of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (days to evaluation and lab batches taking a week to a couple of weeks [nKuxu_x-s6o @ 00:05:36]. Payment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (structure splits by data type: ongoing access can be paid over time, while historical data typically draws a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (one-time payment covering two to three years of use. Varner quotes ranges of $100K to $3M-plus, with a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm ($10M deal heard of, depending on exclusivity. Gatekeeping is real. OneHourProfessor, promoting an affiliate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (link to MicroOne, lists 30-plus employees, US companies prioritized ahead of the UK and Canada, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (English-language data required, adding that clearing those bars is no promise of acceptance [SU66nYi95IY) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (@ 00:02:24].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (For creative digital IP, Gait Gain gives the most granular production spec. Vector illustrations, icon sets,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (textures and patterns are built in Adobe Illustrator or Affinity Designer with named layers, outlined paths,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (RGB for screens and CMYK for print, then packaged into themed bundles such as AI, eco-energy and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (fintech. Audio ships as 24-bit/48 kHz WAV with stems, loops, and 15-second plus full-length edits) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm ([lvsa9U4qZJA @ 00:04:23]. Contracts cover grant of rights, field of use, territory, duration, payment terms) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (and IP indemnification, and fee options are a flat buyout, an annual renewal or a percentage royalty) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm ([lvsa9U4qZJA @ 00:08:42]. Protection is layered: audio tags every 10 to 15 seconds, plus steganography) Tj ET
